Rule 2 (image must have either 3 or 4 dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 3 ∨ ndim(v_1) = 4
>>
Rule 3 (inner 3 dims of image must be > 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 3 then shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0 else if ndim(v_1) = 4 then shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 3) > 0 else false
